  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/738",
  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br>네!!<br>&#160;<br><br><br>저는<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">마이크로비트가 무!섭!습!니!다!&#160;</span></b><br>&#160;<br><br><br>자바실험실 이동준선생님께서<br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">&quot;너무 이쁘다&quot; 고 하셨지만</span></b><br>&#160;<br>제게 마.이.크.로.비.트.는&#160;<br>그냥 무섭게 생긴<br><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a201f82f4ccbf0c384c9fe268e4bf7d518ec7a3b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a201f82f4ccbf0c384c9fe268e4bf7d518ec7a3b\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\"><br><br>숙제처럼 쌓인 김장 재료</span></b> 같달까요....&#160;<br>ㅠㅅㅠ<br>&#160;<br><br><b><span style=\"color: #8A3DB6;\">이번 방학의 숙제, 마깨비</span></b><br>&#160;<br><br>이 글 3분이면<br>버무릴 순 있다,<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">마이크로 김장</span></b><br>&#160;<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8ffa5822b1ebc7e89cd635b450826dde9ce3bdde\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8ffa5822b1ebc7e89cd635b450826dde9ce3bdde\" data-origin-width=\"711\" data-origin-height=\"526\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br><br>맛까지는 보장하지 못하지만<br>같이 담가보시죠. 김장<br><u>맛난 수육이 기다릴 수도 있으니깐요 ㅋ</u><br>&#160;<br><br>GO GO!<br>&#160;<br><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">일단, 삽니다.&#160;</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">무서운 녀석을요.&#160;<br><br></span></b><br>&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size23\">1. 산다 </span></b><br>(저는 참사이언스몰에서 기본세트를<br>10만원 정도...<br>일반 포털에서도 많지만,<br>저는 세트세뚜가...좋아서 ㅠㅠ)<br>&#160;<br><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size23\">2. 깐다 </span></b><br>(자바실험실에서 딱 1번만 프로그램을)<br>&#160;<br><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size23\">3. 수업한다 </span></b><br>(이동준선생님의 자바실험실을 이용해서)<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br><br>사고나서&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">딱 1번 초기작업인&#160;</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">프로그램을 깔아보는 것</span></b>부터<br>해보겠습니다.<br>&#160;<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9bb3d1637253ecdec236aaa52109679bf9f72913\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9bb3d1637253ecdec236aaa52109679bf9f72913\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><br><br>역시,</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">무서운 놈은 무서운 놈입니다.&#160;</span></b><br>생긴거 보세요.<br>-_-;;; 뭣이 저리 많은지....<br>&#160;<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/94bc1ffc8cc49c8605f7b44aebdd6035f5fdba50\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/94bc1ffc8cc49c8605f7b44aebdd6035f5fdba50\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><br><br>PC랑 연결이 필요해서&#160;</span></span></b><br><b>옛날 사다리꼴 모양</b>의<br>충전선을 마이크로비트에 꽂고<br><b>USB는 PC에</b> 꽂아봅니다.<br>&#160;<br><br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/81190d47052371a05591d1d98a9fd0a67e2806ae\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/81190d47052371a05591d1d98a9fd0a67e2806ae\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br><br>아! 깜짝이야!<br>꽂자마자 미친 도깨비 마냥<br>생난리 굿을 합니다.<br>&#160;<br><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">뭘,,,,, 뭘 깔아줘야한다고??</span></b><br>&#160;<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/27156bec400d950a5be5a273d3ac420a10717f39\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/27156bec400d950a5be5a273d3ac420a10717f39\" data-origin-width=\"1154\" data-origin-height=\"790\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\"><br><br>K-과학 시뮬레이션의 자랑, </span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">자바실험실로 갑니다.<br><br></span></b><br><b>대문에 있는 글 클릭! </b><br><b>하단 링크~!</b><br><b><a href=\"https://www.javalab.org/mbl/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.javalab.org/mbl/</a></b></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br><br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/94d7e92f747822f000f38fc05745a040cfb395ae\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/94d7e92f747822f000f38fc05745a040cfb395ae\" data-origin-width=\"1503\" data-origin-height=\"774\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><br><br><b>여러 개 중에 </b><br><b>사실 아무거나 클릭해도 되지만<br><br></b><br><b>초심자의 마음으로 <br></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #8A3DB6;\">정갈하고 공손한 자세로 맨 처음 클릭!</span></b><br>&#160;<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8a04619905d2a9dc979bf7cc7a706e47ffbe98ee\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8a04619905d2a9dc979bf7cc7a706e47ffbe98ee\" data-origin-width=\"1248\" data-origin-height=\"715\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\"><br><br>중간에 파란글씨!!!!!</span></b><br><b>딴거 필요없고!!!!<br><br></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">파란 글씨!!!! 저게 프로그램입니다.</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">우클릭해서 다른이름으로 저장!</span></b><br>&#160;<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2facfb348639f45fbdcf4b817dceff8c3814ad4c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2facfb348639f45fbdcf4b817dceff8c3814ad4c\" data-origin-width=\"819\" data-origin-height=\"406\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br><br>마이크로비트와 PC가 연결되었으면&#160;<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">내PC에 MICROBIT 드라이브가 </span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">이렇게 뜹니다.<br><br></span></b><br><b>저 무서운 놈에게 [저장] 해줍니다.</b><br><b>옜따~! 먹어랏~!</b><br>&#160;<br><br><br>그럼, 기초 작업 끝~!<br>&#160;<br><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size23\">새로 산 무서운 놈에게 </span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size23\">딱 1번만 깔아주면 </span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size23\">다시는 안깔아도 됩니다!</span></b><br>&#160;<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e977ff722b4ffd23b7468d5bc4ef9f05853b346e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e977ff722b4ffd23b7468d5bc4ef9f05853b346e\" data-origin-width=\"532\" data-origin-height=\"411\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;<br><br><br><b>이제 그럼, 수업하러 가실까요?&#160;</b><br><b>슝슝~! ^O^</b><br>&#160;<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7486ed3a51cf015ce656eeb6cc5b8f5e8b110e19\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7486ed3a51cf015ce656eeb6cc5b8f5e8b110e19\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><br><br>전자기기이니</b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">배터리는 필수</span>라네요.<br><br></b><br>(아니~ 이럴꺼면 그냥 배터리도 아예 붙여서 쫌~!! 싶..... 아...네...ㅋ)<br>&#160;<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/56c740e64ab4f47d1638a8b7cbb19c906685706b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/56c740e64ab4f47d1638a8b7cbb19c906685706b\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><br><br><br>선 한번 꽂아줍니다 ㅋ</b><br>&#160;<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/82f93f4c89e400b8d036079d6ddebcbff68d22ec\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/82f93f4c89e400b8d036079d6ddebcbff68d22ec\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br><br><br>무서운데 <b>까다롭기까지 -_- </b><br><b>방향성도 있네요.<br><br></b><br>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/579076225223c225dd3bff14fe618147e205518a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/579076225223c225dd3bff14fe618147e205518a\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br><br><br>덜렁거리면 꼴이 영 그렇쥬~<br><b>그까이꺼 대~~충 묶어줍니다.<br><br></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">(아놔, 준비물이 필요하네... 고무줄 -_-;;)</span></b><br>&#160;<br><br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a988dfab6f27e02e5b6889508a93de29a0b5a5d9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a988dfab6f27e02e5b6889508a93de29a0b5a5d9\" data-origin-width=\"756\" data-origin-height=\"1492\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><br><br>PC와 폰 모두 과정은 동일합니다.&#160;</b><br>자바실험실의 아까 그<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">프로그램 깔았던 글 클릭~!<br><br></span></b><br>&lt;내장 가속도계&gt; 링크 하단!<br><a href=\"https://www.javalab.org/microbit_mbl_accelerometer/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.javalab.org/microbit_mbl_accelerometer/</a><br><br><br>&#160;<br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">근데, 폰은 안드로이드 (아이폰 노노)</span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">즉, <span style=\"color: #006DD7;\">갤럭시로 [크롬 브라우져] 쓸 때</span></span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">가장 확실하다고 합니다.</span></b><br>&#160;<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b923ee5b57fe3a225f782ec6513bd38e204fb821\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b923ee5b57fe3a225f782ec6513bd38e204fb821\" data-origin-width=\"756\" data-origin-height=\"1492\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\"><br><br>폰에 블루투스 켜고</span></b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">[Micro bit 연결] 클릭~!!<br><br></span></b><br><b>폰이랑 무서운 놈을 연결하는거죠.</b><br>&#160;<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1ed3c3806b7c4b37585419af8b2a01e7d96882fc\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1ed3c3806b7c4b37585419af8b2a01e7d96882fc\" data-origin-width=\"1400\" data-origin-height=\"1050\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br><br>연결을 누르면&#160;<br>마이크로비트 장치에<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">요녀석의 이름이 순서대로 나옵니다.<br><br></span></b><br><b>알파벳 5글자 정도입니다.&#160;</b><br>(위 이미지가 알파벳 v, 뷔~ ^O^)&#160;<br><br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1cb0ee210b67f3151b6f9a2f1da709f5d835d414\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1cb0ee210b67f3151b6f9a2f1da709f5d835d414\" data-origin-width=\"756\" data-origin-height=\"1492\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><br><br><br>그럼, <span style=\"color: #8A3DB6;\">이름을 확인하고 [페어링] 클릭~!</span></b><br>&#160;<br><br><br><b>교실에서 <span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">많은 아이들이 페어링을 하면</span></b><br><b>장치 이름 확인이 꼭 필요하겠죠~</b><br>&#160;<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7e72209fcb1b04b39dc23728431c7ddbba8a0243\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7e72209fcb1b04b39dc23728431c7ddbba8a0243\" data-origin-width=\"756\" data-origin-height=\"1492\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><br><br><br>그럼, 아까 그 사이트가 </b><br><b>모습이 갑자기 바뀌고</b><br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">그래프가 뜹니다.</span></b><br>&#160;<br><br><br><b>우와~!</b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">K-시뮬레이션, </span></b><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">갓동준 선생님 &#52573;오~!</span></b><br>&#160;<br><br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f6b67805f6c406a7d1de871593fab1e7a8b8177f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f6b67805f6c406a7d1de871593fab1e7a8b8177f\" data-origin-width=\"756\" data-origin-height=\"1492\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><br><br>무서운 놈을 던져올리거나 움직이면</b><br><b>그래프가 왐마....<br><br></b><br><b>지능형 과학실이</b><br><b>내 손에 펼쳐지네요.</b><br>&#160;<br><br><br>오호~!<br>&#160;<br>이젠 정말 쓰기 나름이겠&#52012;?<br>&#160;<br><br><br>더하면 수육 체하니깐,<br><b><span style=\"color: #EE2323;\">온도계는 투비 컨티뉴드....ㅋ</span></b><br>&#160;<br><br><br><b><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">해피 베케이션 입니당!<br><br></span></b></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
